      "body": "## Summary\n\nStartup validation already rejects HiCache `buffer_only` host memory with the `write_back` policy, because buffer-only host memory is transient and cannot retain deferred writes. Runtime storage attachment accepted the same incompatible combination.\n\nReject `buffer_only + write_back` at the beginning of runtime attachment, before policy mutation or storage-controller calls. The regression test covers both a fresh attach and a same-backend policy update and verifies that neither path has side effects.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `TestStorageAttachmentPolicyValidation`\n- `TestUnifiedRadixCacheStorageAttachBackfill`\n- 5 tests passed; both compatibility subtests passed\n- Python compilation and `git diff --check`\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36371791808](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36371791808)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36371791546](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36371791546)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36371791809](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36371791809)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
